{"lines": ["Here is a quiet surprise. One of these sounds has been described two different ways by the same agency.", "An older NOAA Ocean Explorer page said of Slow Down that its origin was unknown, and placed it near fifteen degrees south, one hundred and fifteen west, about two thousand kilometres from the sensors.", "The newer NOAA PMEL page puts it near sixty-two degrees south, off the Antarctic Peninsula, with a range of nearly five thousand kilometres. It also says a drifting iceberg running aground is the source.", "That is not a cover-up. The newer page rests on three sensors and years of comparison with other iceberg sounds. That is science updating.", "Rule six. Date your label. What is unknown today may be known after more data."], "words": [["Here", 0.0, 0.2], ["is", 0.2, 0.36], ["a", 0.36, 0.44], ["quiet", 0.44, 0.7], ["surprise.", 0.7, 1.2], ["One", 1.94, 2.02], ["of", 2.02, 2.12], ["these", 2.12, 2.24], ["sounds", 2.24, 2.54], ["has", 2.54, 2.88], ["been", 2.88, 3.08], ["described", 3.08, 3.38], ["two", 3.38, 3.82], ["different", 3.82, 4.14], ["ways", 4.14, 4.46], ["by", 4.46, 4.8], ["the", 4.8, 4.92], ["same", 4.92, 5.16], ["agency.", 5.16, 5.64], ["An", 6.76, 6.82], ["older", 6.82, 7.06], ["NOAA", 7.06, 7.32], ["Ocean", 7.32, 7.84], ["Explorer", 7.84, 8.32], ["page", 8.32, 8.64], ["said", 8.64, 9.06], ["of", 9.06, 9.2], ["Slow", 9.2, 9.42], ["Down", 9.42, 9.82], ["that", 9.82, 10.06], ["its", 10.06, 10.18], ["origin", 10.18, 10.44], ["was", 10.44, 10.86], ["unknown,", 10.86, 11.22], ["and", 11.68, 12.0], ["placed", 12.0, 12.2], ["it", 12.2, 12.42], ["near", 12.42, 12.6], ["fifteen", 12.6, 13.02], ["degrees", 13.02, 13.3], ["south,", 13.3, 13.74], ["one", 13.74, 13.985], ["hundred", 13.985, 14.23], ["and", 14.23, 14.475], ["fifteen", 14.475, 14.72], ["west,", 14.72, 15.46], ["about", 15.88, 16.16], ["two", 16.16, 16.5], ["thousand", 16.5, 16.84], ["kilometres", 16.84, 17.18], ["from", 17.18, 17.66], ["the", 17.66, 17.8], ["sensors.", 17.8, 18.12], [